{"title":"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df793f542a5d7553f680883d78fd27b7dcc76a4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{93}-93$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" /> is expressed as a single whole number, the sum of the digits is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/5/fc50d0f830a1ac1450280ee9d7090765d8dbf0b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 93 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 819 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 826 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 833$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"402\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/561f4294abaefd22aba5e339a36650c8d5cb6370.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 10^2-93&amp;=7\\\\ 10^3-93&amp;=907\\\\ 10^4-93&amp;=9907\\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"125\" height=\"71\" />\n</p><p>This can be generalized into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/b/85b1802fc571f2a58785a0378546d64e45b06d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^n-93$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" /> is equal is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/9/ef9b02e32cfba0db0f9038a8d077596720f62e91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> nines followed by the digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/7627644a89f282d552759f4a747db38777bb801e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$07$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df793f542a5d7553f680883d78fd27b7dcc76a4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{93}-93$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/d/7fd34ff50f8bba26a08bc96a69e921daa60f5f12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> nines followed by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/7627644a89f282d552759f4a747db38777bb801e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$07$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />. The sum of the digits is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e0eda9e20ad586cd301ddd732f0a27cd74822ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9(91)+7=819+7=\\boxed{\\text{(D)}\\ 826}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME\" title=\"1993 AJHSME\">1993 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/